    },
    "voice": "produce_communications/180100100011/1801001000110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうした？\r\n何かあったのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1801001000110020,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "ちょっと夢見が悪くてさ、\r\n入院してる夢見ちゃった",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180100100011/1801001000110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ、夢の話か\r\nしかし入院か……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "select": "入院中って暇だよな",
    "nextLabel": "1801001000111"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "select": "病院食って苦手だな",
    "nextLabel": "1801001000112"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "select": "入院中は休めていいよな",
    "nextLabel": "1801001000113"
  },
  {
    "id": 1801001000110030,
    "label": "1801001000111",
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "そうなんだよね、何もできないし！\r\n何もできる元気もないし。入院してるから当然だけど",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180100100011/1801001000110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1801001000110040,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "テレビ見たりとかゲームしたりだとか、\r\nそれくらいしかできないもん、健康で良かったー",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180100100011/1801001000110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1801001000110050,
    "label": "1801001000112",
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "そう？　私は意外といけたけど……\r\nあー、でも味付けが薄くて量も少ないもんね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180100100011/1801001000110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1801001000110060,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "健康的なのは間違いないし、\r\n自然と痩せられるかもよ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180100100011/1801001000110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1801001000110070,
    "label": "1801001000113",
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "まあ、そうだね。退院の目途があるなら、\r\nちょっとした休みかもしれないけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180100100011/1801001000110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1801001000110080,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "退院したくてもできない子も世の中に沢山いるんだよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180100100011/1801001000110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うっ……しまった。別のことを言えば良かったな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
